sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Src as Source Node A
    participant Relay as Relay Node B
    participant Dest as Destination Node C

    Src->>Src: Compose Message & Encrypt AES-256
    Src->>Src: Check RouteTable for Dest
    Src->>Relay: Transmit MeshMessage(dest=C, hopCount=0)

    Note over Relay: Relay receives incoming packet
    Relay->>Relay: Check DuplicateSuppressionCache(msgId)
    Relay->>Relay: Validate hopCount (0 <= 3)
    Relay->>Relay: Look up next hop for Node C

    Relay->>Dest: Forward MeshMessage(dest=C, hopCount=1)

    Note over Dest: Terminal Destination Reached
    Dest->>Dest: Check DuplicateCache & Verify Not Duplicate
    Dest->>Dest: Decrypt Payload using AES-256
    Dest->>Dest: Display in Chat Thread & Store in DB

    Dest->>Relay: Send ACK(originalMsgId, dest=A, hopCount=0)
    Relay->>Src: Forward ACK(originalMsgId, dest=A, hopCount=1)

    Note over Src: Src receives ACK -> Mark Message DELIVERED